   432	/// Convert a `Math` s-expression string back to a karva (head, tail) pair.
   433	///
   434	/// BFS the parsed tree to produce the head (level-order: functions then the
   435	/// terminals they reference), then re-pad the tail with random terminals to the
   436	/// GEP rule `tail_len = head_len * (n_max - 1) + 1` (n_max = the pset's max
   437	/// function arity), deterministically from `rng_seed`.
