   967	/// Soundness: replacing a variable-free subtree by its own evaluated value is
   968	/// an f64-exact identity under the crate's evaluator. Subtrees that evaluate
   969	/// non-finite (out-of-domain constants) are left symbolic. Bare leaves are
   970	/// never touched — a lone `(Var "pi")` stays a symbol (readability + snap).
   971	/// Caveat: a DATA COLUMN named like a registered constant would shadow it at
   972	/// eval time; callers gate the folded form on the data (R^2), which rejects
   973	/// the fold in that pathological case.
